      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Standalone DR for Databricks workspace secrets (scopes, values, ACLs). EXPORT runs in the PRIMARY (us-east-2) as the DR service principal: detect changes from system.access.audit (native), read values via the get-secret API, envelope-encrypt (KMS data key + AES-GCM), and write a bundle to the primary S3 bucket. Bidirectional S3 CRR mirrors it to us-west-2 with no secondary compute. On failover the PROMOTED workspace imports from its local bucket (create_scope / put_secret / put_acl). SDK-only -> runs in a notebook, a job, or locally.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Standalone DR for Databricks workspace secrets (scopes, values, ACLs). EXPORT runs in the PRIMARY (us-east-2) as the DR service principal: detect changes from system.access.audit (native), read values via the get-secret API, envelope-encrypt (KMS data key + AES-GCM), and write a bundle to the primary S3 bucket. Bidirectional S3 CRR mirrors it to us-west-2 with no secondary compute. On failover the PROMOTED workspace imports from its local bucket (create_scope / put_secret / put_acl). SDK-only -> runs in a notebook, a job, or locally.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 12
    },
    {
