      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "4. ENCRYPT + BUNDLE: KMS generate_data_key + AES-256-GCM per value (scope/key bound as AAD); write <bucket>/secrets/<bundle_id>/bundle.json (+ _latest.txt), SSE-KMS.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. ENCRYPT + BUNDLE: KMS generate_data_key + AES-256-GCM per value (scope/key bound as AAD); write <bucket>/secrets/<bundle_id>/bundle.json (+ _latest.txt), SSE-KMS.",
