      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "5. S3 CRR (bidirectional) mirrors the bundle east<->west automatically - no compute in the secondary. Control tables (dr_secrets_inventory + dr_secrets_audit) record state + RPO.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. S3 CRR (bidirectional) mirrors the bundle east<->west automatically - no compute in the secondary. Control tables (dr_secrets_inventory + dr_secrets_audit) record state + RPO.",
